  "There's a particular happiness in rediscovering a song you loved years ago and realizing it still holds up completely.",
  "The smell of a bakery early in the morning can turn an ordinary errand into the best part of someone's whole day.",
  "A good surprise, the rare kind that actually lands well, tends to be remembered far longer than the person planning it expects.",
