  "There's a small, real happiness in a perfectly ripe piece of fruit eaten at exactly the right moment.",
  "The first genuinely cool evening after a long summer makes an entire neighborhood seem to exhale at once.",
  "There's something satisfying about arriving somewhere exactly on time, neither rushed nor waiting, just precisely on schedule.",
