  "A song coming on at exactly the right moment during a drive can make an ordinary commute feel like the opening of a good story.",
  "There's real joy in teaching someone else how to do something you love and watching them get genuinely excited about it too.",
  "The best kind of tired is the one after a full day outside, when sleep arrives without needing to be convinced.",
